        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Warwick Lindley, Nora Ephron, Delia Ephron, Tom Hanks, Meg Ryan\n- Roles: cinematographer, director, writer, actor\n- Films: Field of Dreams, Bewitched, Pleasantville, You've Got Mail\n\nFacts:\n- John Warwick Lindley was born on November 17, 1951, in New York City.\n- John Warwick Lindley is an American cinematographer.\n- John Warwick Lindley is best known for his work on the films Field of Dreams, Bewitched, Pleasantville, and You've Got Mail.\n- You've Got Mail is a 1998 American romantic comedy-drama film.\n- Nora Ephron directed You've Got Mail.\n- Nora Ephron and Delia Ephron co-wrote You've Got Mail.\n- Tom Hanks and Meg Ryan starred in You've Got Mail.",
